{"ID":"20240513083019-zd81rkj","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083019-zd81rkj","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083019-zd81rkj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513172123-hz6xh17\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513172123-hz6xh17\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:100,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513172123-hz6xh17\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:1028,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:1028\u0026#125;","title":"293","type":"doc","updated":"20240514174754"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513172123-hz6xh17","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 896px;","id":"20240513172123-hz6xh17","updated":"20240514174754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/05/12"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"218-7 L, YH"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"M"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"69歲  瘦"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/05/21"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝癌術後"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二便：大便一日七八行。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胸腹：上次的腹水可能講錯了，是脹氣，但是腹水那個藥已經吃一星期了，沒有改善，還是一樣。心臟還是覺緊緊的，整天覺得腹部脹脹的，有吃東西和沒吃東西也是一樣。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"其它：體力不好，肝還是痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診： \n2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"診斷：肝家陰實好轉中。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方：\n曲池、足三里"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→針對肩關節不好活動。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"後谿、申脈"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→針對後部大筋痛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"公孫、內關"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→治胃心胸部之病。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"天突、巨闕、關元"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→治心，心募巨關，小腸募關元。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"期門、左肝關→治肝，肝募期門。章門"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→治臟病，臟會章門。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"水分、水道、陰陵泉"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→利水。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"天柱、大杼"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→治天柱痛，因陽氣不足。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肝俞、脾俞、腎俞"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→治肝實脾補腎。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"委中"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→治腰痛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方：有二包未服，取回金鈴子、延胡索，加入厚朴三錢、代赭石三錢。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說：\n1.脹氣和腹水差不了多少，我們是用滲利法，比如游泳池很大，我們挖個小洞讓水流出來，這叫滲利法，所以我們開淡利的藥，如芡實，蓮子，薏仁，茯苓，澤瀉、陳皮、通草這是淡味的藥，就是讓它慢慢滲出來，如果我們用通利法大下，你腹中營養的水，一攻下來你就貧血，當你貧血的時候，我們開補藥，就補到癌細胞，那會更壞，所以我們要用滲利的方法，這是唯一最好的方法，所以我們開分消湯，是用輕劑而不是用重劑，重點就在這裡。所以你吃這藥，會小便次數多，而量會比較少，這是我們要的，我把劑量加重，你小便會增加，但營養會流失很快，所以你小便顏色對我們來說很重要，你如果給西醫去抽水，抽完後水馬上回來，因為你是用大下通利法不是滲利法。我幫你消下去後，腹水就不會再回來。\n2.我們有一些通氣的藥，像厚朴行氣，代赭石降氣，加進去就曉得是不是脹氣了。\n3.我們處理的非常小心。你的案例比較特殊，因為你給西醫動過，如果你沒有開刀栓塞，在一發現腫瘤的時候，紿我治，百分之百可以治好你，我們能夠把你胃口保持很好，睡得很好，痛減輕已經在延長你的壽命而這個訣竅就在滲利。\n4.把金鈴子和延胡索拿出來，因為這兩味藥行氣止痛，所以大便會多一點。\n5.我們說治肝一定要治大腸，下利比便秘好，肝癌到後來腹水很大，小便沒了，大便排不出來了，就不行了。這時的大便多並不是下利，因為處方中並沒有加大黃。\n6.厚朴和代赭石作用和訶子正好相反。氣利，排氣太多了，我們用訶子；而要幫助排氣我們用厚朴。\n7.健康的人不動一定會生病，生病的人再不動一定死，你一個星期除了上廁所躺在床上不動，一定腳腫，男子腳腫是重症。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}